        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVGwBs33f_vtBgI584Uy0e_xEu043s46jGOk1Ejf6XQ3L-6O0SUA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "People are so picky to leave 3 stars. Yes the prices are high bit food is excellent.  Services is good.  Owner even change things for mw so I didnt have to spend 130$.",
        "time": 1763766460,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "silversevenron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117261426875975651582/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDScqwpvE9P_2iYoeW1XRMI3LUDTMK6q-5c_S_u3PCnubhnA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Slow service waited over an hour for take out , even though was called in advance , error on billing so was charged extra 10$ …. Apparently no longer the deal  it used to be , quite expensive actually think there’s better places to get quick food !\nBeen a take out client for years , don’t think I will be back .",
        "time": 1765065886,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rock Hayeur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112579543931197788599/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfZUw3cn1_zyohusNv3ee0mODJKTkR7FxUZwnJLp2iGtIcn30=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I wanted to go back for the salad bar I missed last time.I also think quality of the buffet explains the price.I need to slow down and chew my food more too next time I go.I will try it one more time to decide whether I come once a month after leaving the Dream Center!nb:I need to choose healthy protein ie: steamed\nchicken shrimp ,fish…!",
        "time": 1764889344,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marlon Noneyobidness",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113476434210148445710/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcvLFca_BKU6jyVLiegK3it4qP-DnkJR2cEqLr7OL2etXL2U8u6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Super average Chinese buffet. Nothing to write home about but not terrible either. Buffet food has gotten exorbitantly expensive though.\nOne thing that bugged me was the salmon and pepper beef were both really over cooked and was the two least enjoyable things I ate.",
        "time": 1754886480,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Scott Stephens-Perrier",
